OL,3,GNEWSAIslands are 'unattractive target'
OL,4,Afor migrants
OL,5,
OL,6,FMigrant smuggling networks see the
OL,7,Fbailiwick as an "unattractive target",
OL,8,Faccording to officials responsible for
OL,9,Fpolicing and borders.
OL,11,FIt follows reports of a migrant vessel
OL,12,Fcrossing directly from Normandy to
OL,13,FPortsmouth and passing much closer to
OL,14,Fthe islands than is usual for small
OL,15,Fboat crossings.
OL,17,FThe Committee for Home Affairs said
OL,18,Fthere was "currently no evidence to
OL,19,Fsuggest the Channel Islands are being
OL,20,Factively targeted" and the islands were
OL,21,Fwell protected by their geography and
OL,22,Fborder arrangements.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
