OL,3,GNEWSAIslands are 'unattractive target'
OL,4,Afor migrants
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe committee's president Deputy Marc
OL,7,FLeadbeater said the States of Guernsey
OL,8,Fwas "not complacent" and had
OL,9,Fwell-established plans to respond to
OL,10,Fany incident.
